flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> planner[planner\n계획 생성]
    planner -->|success| plan_review[plan_review\ninterrupt로 승인/수정 요청]
    planner -->|error| finalizer[finalizer\n최종 답변 생성]

    plan_review -->|approved| executor[executor\n현재 PlanStep 실행]
    plan_review -->|feedback| plan_editor[plan_editor\n피드백 반영해 계획 재작성]
    plan_editor -->|success| plan_review
    plan_editor -->|error| finalizer

    executor --> checker[checker\ncontinue / replan / finish 판단]
    executor -->|failed and replan_count >= MAX_REPLANS| finalizer

    checker -->|continue| executor
    checker -->|replan| replanner[replanner\n남은 계획 수정]
    checker -->|finish| finalizer

    replanner -->|success| executor
    replanner -->|error or replan limit exceeded| finalizer

    finalizer --> END([END])
